Copyright (c) 2026 Kerem Özdemir, all rights reserved. They are published
here to be read, linked to and quoted from under the ordinary limits of
quotation. They are not published for republication, for translation, or
for use as training data.

A curriculum vitae is a statement about a particular person and stops being
true the moment somebody else uses it. That is the reason for the split,
and it is the same split the simea repository makes for the same reason.

If you want to reuse something and are unsure which half it falls in, ask:
kozdemir3523@gmail.com

